        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-use-the-lingo-4-0fabcd91-a15d-4eab-b9e0-a817bdb80c3c",
        "text": "###Sections of a webpage\n\nWhen you name the section you want to work on it makes it easier to build with AI.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/e96e3780990834ef3974ef3d80947dfb-adaptive-HoAI26-use-the-lingo-4-panel-1-63cc02fd-4ac4-46cf-a853-c80dd9d66f8b.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-use-the-lingo-4-d0f02545-840a-4370-95c5-1425103a1f5d",
        "text": "###Hero Banner\n\nThe **hero** section introduces your page. \n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/6e27590f581e1959b18f5a8ea039ff1e-panda1.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-use-the-lingo-4-1774d6c3-2655-47d6-a5f8-adc23ff053d4",
        "text": "###Feature Cards\n\nSmaller 'feature cards' show key info or options.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/52e6642b23f6181e5df952febf841421-row-09-PAN-2-refined.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-use-the-lingo-4-7cf960b2-c941-4a0e-b99a-620e481caad4",
        "text": "###Interactive Canvas\nAn 'interactive canvas' lets users play or create.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b28e0cbb266cd58f7823fe3a7231b354-row-10-PAN-3-refined.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-use-the-lingo-4-72392717-95fb-44d8-82e3-9599f4c8b802",
        "text": "###Call-to-action\nA 'call-to-action' button guides you to the next step.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/951d163dd70c6a286be2faf6a9343312-row-11-PAN-4-refined.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Watch an animated video that tours common web page parts. See how a page builds block by block, with each section popping in to reveal its name and function, such as hero, feature cards, or call-to-action.",
